MID_MV14_05: <SH>
MID_MV14_05_m001: Sembra che tu non ci sia più di alcuna utilità.
MID_MV14_05_m002: No, quella era...
MID_MV14_05_m003: Quella era la...
MID_MV14_05_m004: (quiet gasp)
MID_MV14_05_m005: (chuckle)
MID_MV14_05_m006: (grunt of effort)
MID_MV14_05_m007: (gasp of horror)
MID_MV14_05_m008: Padre, sei...
MID_MV14_05_m009: (heartbroken exert)
MID_MV14_05_m010: (gasp)
MID_MV14_05_m011: (dodge exert x2)
MID_MV14_05_m012: Il tuo più profondo desiderio non è\nforse... morire per mano di tuo padre?
MID_MV14_05_m013: Addio, Leilidahna.
MID_MV14_05_m014: No... Non posso...
MID_MV14_05_m015: (bracing gasp) (slow exhale of confusion)
MID_MV14_05_m016: (grunt of pain)
MID_MV14_05_m017: Sei ferita?
MID_MV14_05_m018: (shuddering, disbelieving gasp)
MID_MV14_05_m019: (grunt of pain)
MID_MV14_05_m020: (horrified gasp)
MID_MV14_05_m021: Sono un traditore... Ti chiederai... perché l'ho fatto...
MID_MV14_05_m022: Ti ho sempre amata... come una figlia...
MID_MV14_05_m023: (slowly solidifying resolve)